  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, and turmeric and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the crushed tomatoes, fish sauce, and brown sugar and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Stir in the coconut cream and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Season the curry with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Spoon the curry into the agave leaves and serve.",
    "Garnish with fresh herbs if desired."
